lorebook.content:
{{#if {{equal::{{getvar::ab}}::0}}}}

🌐 Common World Setting: The Barony of Veridia
*This setting applies to all difficulty levels.*
1. Background: A territory devastated by the 50-year "War of the Sunderlands." The previous lord looted all human and material resources before deserting.
2. Status: {{user}} is a decorated veteran who received the deed to this dying land from the Crown as a "reward" for military service.
3. Initial Assets: Approx. 110 residents (elderly, women, and wounded veterans), a derelict manor, a contaminated well, and 0 starting gold.


{{#if {{equal::{{getvar::Difficulty}}::1}}}}
🟡 Difficulty: Hard (Realism Mode)
- AI Narrative Persona: A cold, realistic administrator.
- Instruction: Treat user input as a "wish" rather than an "absolute command."
- Execution: Regardless of the command, the AI must first calculate the "actual feasibility" based on current resources (materials, labor, technology). 
- Outcome: Success is never guaranteed. If conditions are insufficient, report results as "failed despite the attempt" or "only partially successful," citing realistic constraints.


{{/if}}

{{#if {{equal::{{getvar::Difficulty}}::2}}}}
🔴 Difficulty: Hell (Simulation Mode)
- AI Narrative Persona: The indifferent laws of a harsh world.
- Instruction: The user is NOT the "Hero" of this story; "Plot Armor" does not exist.
- Execution: The AI must NOT manufacture forced survival or dramatic reversals for the user's benefit. Coldly calculate outcomes based solely on current stats, capabilities, and the logic of the user's decisions.
- Outcome: Failure is common; ruin and death are realistic possibilities. Reflect pure human drama—tragedy, desperate failure, or achievements earned through heavy sacrifice.

{{/if}}



{{/if}}


{{#if {{equal::{{getvar::ab}}::1}}}}
You have been selected as a proud royal attendant.

Her Majesty the Queen commands you to conduct secret intelligence operations while serving as an attendant to three princesses, seeking the most suitable candidate for the next succession to the throne.

{{user}} may freely choose to become a loyal attendant, supporting the one most fitting for the next throne, or simply observe quietly and report back.

{{/if}}

{"simcore":"0.1","meta":{"name":"베리디아 남작령"},"time":{"start":"1499-03-01 08:00","advance":"explicit","calendar":"flat30","format":{"date":"YYYY년 M월 D일"},"seasons":["🍀봄","🌻여름","🍂가을","⛄겨울"],"expose":["date","season","year","month","dom","elapsed"]},"calendar":{"label":"달력","icon":"🕐","note":"축일과 기한(계약·공사)이 날짜에 걸린다.","marks":[{"month":1,"dom":15,"label":"한밤절","note":"한 해에서 밤이 가장 긴 무렵. 불을 끄지 않고 새운다. 이 밤에 화로가 꺼진 집은 한 해 내내 입에 오른다."},{"month":2,"dom":5,"label":"잿날","note":"겨울에 죽은 이를 태워 보내는 날. 언 땅에 묻지 못한 시신이 이날 한꺼번에 화장된다."},{"month":3,"dom":10,"label":"파종절","note":"첫 씨앗을 뿌리는 날. 영주가 첫 고랑을 파는 것이 관례다. 남작이 흙을 만지는 걸 사람들이 지켜본다."},{"month":4,"dom":22,"label":"강신제","note":"봄비를 부르는 날. 강물을 떠다 밭에 뿌린다. 비가 오면 길조, 안 오면 흉흉한 말이 돈다."},{"month":5,"dom":15,"label":"초록절","note":"겨우내 굶은 뒤 처음 푸른 것을 먹는 날. 나물 한 줌이라도 온 마을이 나눈다."},{"month":6,"dom":8,"label":"성 알드릭 축일","note":"변경을 지키다 죽은 기사 성인의 날. 무기를 손질하고 젊은 사내들이 겨룬다."},{"month":7,"dom":20,"label":"화톳날","note":"낮이 가장 긴 날. 밤새 언덕마다 불을 피운다. 불이 크면 그 영지가 산다는 말이 있다."},{"month":8,"dom":12,"label":"기우절","note":"가뭄이 드는 달, 비를 비는 날. 이날까지 비가 없으면 가을을 포기하는 이야기가 나온다."},{"month":9,"dom":25,"label":"수확제","note":"한 해 가장 큰 축일. 사흘간 일을 멈춘다. 곳간이 비어 있어도 사람들은 잔치를 기대한다."},{"month":10,"dom":10,"label":"세납일","note":"백작령에 세를 바치는 날. 축일이 아니라 두려운 날이다. 못 내면 문책이 오고, 그것이 다음 겨울을 정한다."},{"month":11,"dom":1,"label":"위령절","note":"죽은 자를 기리는 밤. 전쟁에서 죽은 이가 많은 땅이라 이 밤은 유난히 길다."},{"month":12,"dom":28,"label":"긴밤제","note":"한 해의 끝. 남은 것을 헤아리고 겨울을 셈한다. 이날 곳간을 열어 보이는 것이 관례다."}],"css":"
.scg-card { background:#f0e5d1; border:5px solid #4a2c2a; border-radius:4px; color:#3d352a;
  width:min(520px,100%); font-family:'Noto Serif KR','Nanum Myeongjo',serif; }
.scg-title { color:#4a2c2a; border-bottom:2px double #bda27e; padding-bottom:6px; }
.scg-title .scg-x { color:#4a2c2a; }
.scg-note { color:#6b5744; }
.scc-nav .scc-month { color:#4a2c2a; }
.scc-nav button { background:#f0e5d1; border:1px solid #bda27e; color:#3d352a; }
.scc-nav button:hover { background:#e2d3b6; border-color:#4a2c2a; }
.scc-wd { color:#6b5744; }
.scc-day { background:rgba(255,255,255,.35); border-color:#d8c6a4; color:#3d352a; }
.scc-day:hover { background:rgba(74,44,42,.08); border-color:#bda27e; }
.scc-day.scc-today { border-color:#a12a2a; background:#f5e3e3; }
.scc-day.scc-sel { border-color:#4a2c2a; box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #4a2c2a inset; }
.scc-dot.scc-mark { background:#bda27e; }
.scc-dot.scc-due { background:#a12a2a; }
.scc-detail { background:rgba(255,255,255,.35); border-color:#bda27e; }
.scc-detail-date { color:#4a2c2a; }
.scc-entry .scc-kind { color:#6b5744; }
.scc-legend { color:#6b5744; }"},"vars":[{"id":"skip_day","label":"흐른 날","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":3650,"desc":"Days that passed in this response. Next morning = 1, three days later = 3, next week = 7, a month later = 30, a whole winter = 90 — write the full number the narration covers; there is no cap. Leave it at 0 while the scene stays within the same day — the date, daily consumption and harvest all move only with this."},{"id":"time","label":"시각","type":"enum","init":"🕗아침","enum":["🌅새벽","🕗아침","🕛낮","🕗저녁","🌙밤"]},{"id":"weather","label":"날씨","type":"enum","init":"☀️맑음","enum":["☀️맑음","⛅흐림","🌧비","⛈폭풍우","❄️눈","🌫안개","🔥폭염","🥶한파"]},{"id":"location","label":"위치","type":"text","init":"베리디아 성채","maxLength":24},{"id":"disaster","label":"진행 중인 재해","type":"text","init":"","maxLength":40,"desc":"Name of the disaster currently underway; empty string if none. Start a new one only when disaster_days is 0."},{"id":"disaster_days","label":"재해 잔여","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":30,"desc":"How many more days the disaster runs. The system counts it down and clears it at 0. Set it only at the start."},{"id":"day","label":"경과일","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"desc":"부임 후 며칠째. 시계(elapsed)에서 매 턴 동기화된다. 시스템이 센다. 손대지 말 것."},{"id":"day_prev","label":"(내부) 지난 정산일","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"desc":"지난 턴 정산 시점의 경과일. 시스템 전용이니 직접 바꾸지 마라."},{"id":"lack_food","label":"(내부) 이번 정산의 굶은 날","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"desc":"시스템 전용. 이번 정산 기간 중 곳간이 빈 날 수."},{"id":"lack_water","label":"(내부) 이번 정산의 목마른 날","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"desc":"시스템 전용. 이번 정산 기간 중 물이 빈 날 수."},{"id":"lack_gold","label":"(내부) 이번 정산의 빈 금고 날","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"desc":"시스템 전용. 이번 정산 기간 중 금고가 빈 날 수."},{"id":"appt","label":"예정","type":"text","init":"","maxLength":60,"desc":"One thing set to happen. e.g. "Count's envoy arrives". The system deletes it once the day has passed."},{"id":"appt_in","label":"예정까지","type":"int","init":0,"min":-1,"max":60,"desc":"How many days off appt is. Tomorrow = 1, three days = 3. Do not log something happening today — just narrate it. The system counts down; 0 is the day."},{"id":"pop","label":"주민","type":"int","init":110,"min":0,"format":"{v}명"},{"id":"health","label":"보건","type":"int","init":20,"min":0,"max":100},{"id":"morale","label":"사기","type":"int","init":25,"min":0,"max":100},{"id":"labor_policy","label":"노동 배분","type":"enum","enum":["생존 우선","재건 우선","방비 우선","개척 우선"],"init":"생존 우선"},{"id":"food","label":"식량","type":"int","init":1200,"min":0,"desc":"Unit is person-days; one resident eats 1 per day. The system settles this every turn — do not deduct it yourself."},{"id":"water","label":"식수","type":"int","init":500,"min":0,"desc":"Unit is person-days."},{"id":"gold","label":"재정","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"format":"{v}G","cmd":"금"},{"id":"contracts","label":"지속 수입","type":"list","init":[],"maxItems":8,"itemMaxLength":48,"cmd":"계약","desc":"What comes in or goes out every day: trade deals, market dues, infrastructure revenue, levies. The per-day number MUST come last — "헤세 상단 양모 계약 +12", "제분소 5", "성벽 보수 부담 -4". For a fixed term add "@+days" (a year is 360 days), e.g. a 3-year deal is "@+1080" — the system dates it. No @ means indefinite. No trailing number counts as 0. Never add an entry already listed."},{"id":"supply","label":"수입","type":"list","init":[],"maxItems":6,"itemMaxLength":32,"cmd":"수입","desc":"Standing deliveries of goods coming IN, paid for automatically out of the treasury. Every entry MUST begin with 식량 or 식수 and end with the amount arriving per day — "식량 헤세 상단 밀 40", "식수 강물 수레 25". Nothing else belongs here: a one-off purchase moves food or gold directly, and money owed with no goods attached is a contract. Never write the cost — the system prices it. Remove the line when the arrangement ends."},{"id":"stock","label":"보유 물자","type":"list","init":["목재 100"],"maxItems":10,"cmd":"물자","desc":"Things stacked in store, with how much. Not places — places go in the lists below."},{"id":"houses","label":"주거","type":"list","init":["남은 오두막 90","성채 헛간 30"],"maxItems":8,"itemMaxLength":32,"cmd":"주거","desc":"Where people sleep. The number MUST come last and is how many it houses — "장옥 60", "흙집 12". Their sum is the hard ceiling on population: nobody new settles once it is reached."},{"id":"infra","label":"인프라","type":"list","init":["무너진 병영","잡초 연병장","폐허 대장간","오염된 우물"],"maxItems":14,"itemMaxLength":24,"cmd":"인프라","desc":"What keeps the holding running — water works, baths, chapel, forge, walls, roads, storage. Name only, no number. Wells and channels belong here; when one is finished raise wells too."},{"id":"farms","label":"경작지","type":"list","init":["묵은 밭 4"],"maxItems":8,"itemMaxLength":28,"cmd":"경작지","desc":"Ground that FEEDS people — fields, orchards, pasture, fishing waters, mushroom caves. The number MUST come last: how much it adds to farmland quality (a cleared plot ~1, a whole reclaimed valley ~4). Their sum drives the harvest, so never write one without a number."},{"id":"sites","label":"자원지","type":"list","init":[],"maxItems":8,"itemMaxLength":28,"cmd":"자원지","desc":"Places that yield goods to SELL — mines, quarries, salt flats, clay beds, silk groves. The number MUST come last: gold per day once it is actually being worked, 0 while it is only known about. Their sum is added to daily income."},{"id":"route","label":"막힌 길","type":"enum","init":"없음","enum":["없음","북 산길","동 강길","남 가도","서 숲길"],"desc":"Which road is impassable right now. Set it back to "없음" the moment the narration says it is cleared — soldiers driving off the bandits, a thaw, a bridge rebuilt. It does not have to run its full term."},{"id":"route_days","label":"통행 재개까지","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":120,"desc":"Days the closure is expected to last. The system counts it down and reopens the road at zero."},{"id":"blight","label":"농지 피해","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":8},{"id":"wells","label":"식수원","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":5,"desc":"How many usable wells and channels stand. At 0, water must be hauled from the river. Raise it only together with a matching entry in infra."},{"id":"explore_dir","label":"탐사 방향","type":"enum","cmd":"탐사","enum":["없음","북 산맥","서 숲","남 평원","동 강가"],"init":"없음","desc":"Where the scouts are currently working. Set it when the narration sends them somewhere; "없음" means they are kept home."},{"id":"exp_n","label":"북 탐사","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":114},{"id":"exp_w","label":"서 탐사","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":114},{"id":"exp_s","label":"남 탐사","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":114},{"id":"exp_e","label":"동 탐사","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":114},{"id":"f_n","label":"북 발견","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":5},{"id":"f_w","label":"서 발견","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":5},{"id":"f_s","label":"남 발견","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":5},{"id":"f_e","label":"동 발견","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":5},{"id":"o_n","label":"북 시작점","type":"int","init":-1,"min":-1,"max":4},{"id":"o_w","label":"서 시작점","type":"int","init":-1,"min":-1,"max":4},{"id":"o_s","label":"남 시작점","type":"int","init":-1,"min":-1,"max":4},{"id":"o_e","label":"동 시작점","type":"int","init":-1,"min":-1,"max":4},{"id":"army","label":"상비군","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"format":"{v}명"},{"id":"rations","label":"배급","type":"enum","init":"평시","enum":["평시","절약"],"desc":"식량 배급 수위. 액션 버튼(배급 축소/복구)으로만 바꾼다."},{"id":"unrest","label":"내부 불안","type":"int","init":15,"min":0,"max":100},{"id":"threat","label":"외부 위협","type":"int","init":40,"min":0,"max":100},{"id":"fame","label":"명성","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":100,"desc":"Standing among the folk of Veridia itself. What other domains think is rel_* — do not move both for the same event."},{"id":"rel_n","label":"북 모르웬 백작","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":100},{"id":"rel_e","label":"동 리아나 백작","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":100},{"id":"rel_s","label":"남 발레리우스 백작","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":100},{"id":"rel_w","label":"서 실바나 후작","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":100},{"id":"rel_cap","label":"왕도 알라릭 여왕","type":"int","init":10,"min":0,"max":100},{"id":"ally","label":"동행","type":"text","init":"아데레","maxLength":16,"desc":"The one who came along from the exile road. Change only if they leave or are replaced."},{"id":"ally_role","label":"직임","type":"text","init":"책사","maxLength":12,"desc":"The post the companion holds here. e.g. 책사(advisor), 집사(steward), 호위(guard)."},{"id":"b_adere","label":"아데레","type":"int","init":40,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_alaric","label":"알라릭 여왕","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_cassandra","label":"카산드라","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_orelia","label":"오렐리아","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_liliana","label":"릴리아나","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_eleonora","label":"엘레오노라","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_silvana","label":"실바나","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_valerius","label":"발레리우스","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_liana","label":"리아나","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_morwen","label":"모르웬","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_stella","label":"스텔라","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_celestia","label":"셀레스티아","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_lapis","label":"라피스","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_beatrix","label":"베아트릭스","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_philia","label":"필리아","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_serie","label":"세리에","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_livia","label":"리비아","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_fiora","label":"피오라","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_meryl","label":"메릴","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_clarice","label":"클라리스","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_cassia","label":"카시아","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_lulu","label":"룰루","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_lara","label":"라라","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_yustina","label":"유스티나","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_algeria","label":"알제리아","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"b_lirica","label":"리리카","type":"int","init":0,"min":-50,"max":100},{"id":"hire_mult","label":"고용 시세","type":"int","init":100,"min":40,"max":400,"format":"{v}%"},{"id":"hardship","label":"시련","type":"int","init":55,"min":0,"max":100,"format":"{v}"},{"id":"pw_cass","label":"카산드라 세력","type":"int","init":52,"min":5,"max":100},{"id":"pw_orel","label":"오렐리아 세력","type":"int","init":46,"min":5,"max":100},{"id":"pw_lili","label":"릴리아나 세력","type":"int","init":41,"min":5,"max":100},{"id":"lead_who","label":"(내부) 이번 턴 선두","type":"text","init":"카산드라","maxLength":8},{"id":"stance","label":"지지","type":"enum","cmd":"지지","enum":["중립","카산드라","오렐리아","릴리아나"],"init":"중립","desc":"Which claimant the Baron backs. Change it only when the narration shows him actually committing — a letter sent, a word given before witnesses, levies promised. Wondering aloud is not backing."},{"id":"exposed","label":"드러난 정도","type":"int","init":0,"min":0,"max":100,"desc":"How widely known his allegiance is. The system moves it; leave it alone unless the narration shows it deliberately announced or deliberately buried."},{"id":"corps","label":"군단·수녀","type":"list","init":[],"maxItems":16,"itemMaxLength":24,"cmd":"군단","desc":"Maids and sisters actually serving here, hired from the roster. Format is ONLY "Name wage" with the daily wage last — "리비아 8", "스텔라 4". No role, no description. Their sum is paid out of the treasury every day, so an entry without a number is a free servant and that is wrong."},{"id":"duty_home","label":"가사 담당","type":"enum","init":"없음","enum":["없음","스텔라","셀레스티아","라피스","필리아","세리에","리비아","피오라","메릴","클라리스","카시아","룰루","라라","유스티나","알제리아","리리카"],"desc":"가사 직무 담당자 (사기 회복 + 식량 소비 절감). 게임 패널 [배치] 탭에서 앉힌다."},{"id":"duty_guard","label":"호위 담당","type":"en